== Overview ==
The '''Beret Rocket Launcher Toilet''' is a toilet that appears on Wave 40 of [[Nightmare Mode]], and also appears in [[Endless Mode]].

== Appearance ==
He has a winter white urban camo design on his tank, two launchers that hold 8 rockets each, 4 lasers mounted to his side, and he has a beret, which is the [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/27004321/Spetsnaz Spetsnaz] from the Roblox Catalog.

== Abilities ==
Can stun units.

== Trivia ==

* This toilet is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Bill_Tank_Skibidi_Toilet Bill Tank] from the Skibidi Toilet series.
* This toilet has in the current game more health than the [[Giant Smooth Toilet]], Which is strange as the Giant Smooth Toilet is the boss of Nightmare Mode.

